WEBVTT

01:21.289 --> 01:26.789
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.600 --> 01:29.789
[Episode 32]

01:30.789 --> 01:32.120
Lord Chen, you're here.

01:32.759 --> 01:34.200
Miss Zhao is in the main hall.

01:34.200 --> 01:35.150
I'll take you in.

01:35.479 --> 01:35.950
Okay.

01:40.740 --> 01:41.940
[Blessings Passed Down for Generations]

01:41.150 --> 01:42.070
Miss Zhao.

01:42.470 --> 01:43.190
Miss Zhao?

01:45.310 --> 01:45.910
Lord Chen.

01:46.000 --> 01:46.759
Maybe the ladies

01:46.759 --> 01:48.560
went back to their own courtyards.

01:48.560 --> 01:49.680
Please have a seat, Lord Chen.

01:49.680 --> 01:50.680
I'll go find them.

01:50.840 --> 01:51.229
Okay.

02:04.870 --> 02:05.680
Wanxue.

02:06.710 --> 02:07.730
Actually,

02:07.930 --> 02:08.990
there's something

02:09.120 --> 02:10.780
I've been meaning to tell you.

02:11.710 --> 02:12.430
Go ahead.

02:14.750 --> 02:15.470
Third Aunt.

02:20.079 --> 02:20.880
Third Master.

02:21.310 --> 02:22.510
Isn't that the Madam?

02:24.870 --> 02:25.970
You're our elder.

02:26.120 --> 02:26.910
There are a few things

02:26.910 --> 02:28.310
I'd like to say to Wanxue.

02:28.800 --> 02:30.630
I hope you'll bear witness.

02:44.120 --> 02:44.870
Actually,

02:46.190 --> 02:47.360
I've always had

02:47.360 --> 02:48.760
someone else in my heart.

02:52.560 --> 02:53.840
Don't talk nonsense.

02:55.150 --> 02:56.000
You and Wanxue

02:56.070 --> 02:57.190
are engaged.

03:00.470 --> 03:01.310
Who?

03:03.590 --> 03:04.560
Who is she?

03:11.000 --> 03:11.960
Chen Xuanqing.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.080
You are no longer a child.

03:14.590 --> 03:16.210
You should know what to say

03:16.630 --> 03:17.750
and what not to say.

03:18.100 --> 03:26.810
[Hall of Virtue and Splendor]

03:19.750 --> 03:20.630
Tell me.

03:25.800 --> 03:26.750
I can't tell you.

03:27.800 --> 03:29.030
I just want you to know

03:29.710 --> 03:31.110
that there is such a thing

03:31.310 --> 03:32.310
and such a person.

03:33.130 --> 03:34.730
If you don't want to marry me,

03:35.150 --> 03:36.150
we can call off

03:36.450 --> 03:37.650
the engagement.

03:38.100 --> 03:39.000
Enough!

03:39.630 --> 03:40.280
Do you even realize

03:40.280 --> 03:41.410
what you're saying?

03:42.079 --> 03:43.190
What do you mean, if she doesn't want to,

03:43.190 --> 03:44.920
the marriage can be called off?

03:45.079 --> 03:47.079
If you have someone else in your heart,

03:47.079 --> 03:48.960
why make things difficult for her?

03:48.960 --> 03:50.280
This is outrageous!

03:51.960 --> 03:52.520
Wanxue.

03:53.079 --> 03:53.870
Don't worry.

03:54.470 --> 03:55.380
The Chen family

03:55.410 --> 03:57.400
will give you an explanation
regarding this matter.

03:57.400 --> 03:57.910
Let's go.

03:57.910 --> 03:58.520
Wait.

03:59.520 --> 04:00.310
Since you have

04:00.310 --> 04:01.910
another woman in your heart,

04:02.470 --> 04:03.910
why did you propose to me?

04:05.190 --> 04:06.080
Did you fall for her

04:06.080 --> 04:07.940
-after the proposal?
-I liked her

04:09.400 --> 04:10.800
before I came to propose.

04:13.000 --> 04:14.280
Then why?

04:16.829 --> 04:18.490
Because we can't be together.

04:19.750 --> 04:20.510
In this life,

04:22.360 --> 04:23.150
I'm afraid I won't be able

04:23.150 --> 04:23.950
to be with her.

04:24.050 --> 04:25.370
Are you crazy?

04:27.680 --> 04:28.780
If that's the case,

04:30.630 --> 04:32.430
I won't call off the engagement.

04:37.159 --> 04:39.800
I can accept that
you have someone else in your heart.

04:39.800 --> 04:41.200
I still want to marry you.

04:43.680 --> 04:44.940
Why are you doing this?

04:45.600 --> 04:46.159
Because

04:47.120 --> 04:48.980
I've liked you since I was little.

04:49.600 --> 04:51.130
Ever since my father told me

04:51.560 --> 04:53.510
that he would arrange our marriage,

04:53.510 --> 04:55.640
I've been looking forward to that day.

04:57.480 --> 04:59.550
Whenever my stepmother mistreated me,

04:59.550 --> 05:01.040
I would tell myself,

05:01.750 --> 05:02.630
Wanxue,

05:03.800 --> 05:05.400
just bear it a little longer.

05:05.720 --> 05:06.480
You'll be marrying

05:06.480 --> 05:07.680
Xuanqing soon.

05:08.310 --> 05:09.910
Your hard times will be over.

05:12.600 --> 05:14.070
I don't want to call off the engagement.

05:14.070 --> 05:15.750
I don't want to.

05:18.360 --> 05:18.950
Wanxue.

05:19.480 --> 05:19.920
You...

05:19.920 --> 05:20.360
Okay.

05:22.510 --> 05:23.770
Since you are willing,

05:24.870 --> 05:25.690
then we will

05:25.950 --> 05:27.080
proceed as planned.

05:30.190 --> 05:30.870
Third Aunt.

05:32.480 --> 05:33.450
I hope

05:33.870 --> 05:34.630
you won't tell anyone

05:34.630 --> 05:36.159
about what happened today.

05:36.630 --> 05:38.490
Less trouble is better than more,

05:38.560 --> 05:39.320
right?

05:44.430 --> 05:45.510
Since Wanxue

05:46.240 --> 05:47.500
has made her decision,

05:51.870 --> 05:53.670
I naturally won't get involved.

05:55.720 --> 05:56.920
But I also hope you can

05:58.070 --> 06:00.070
be wholehearted toward Wanxue.

06:08.360 --> 06:09.160
Third Master.

06:09.310 --> 06:09.800
This...

06:10.720 --> 06:11.870
Do not mention

06:11.920 --> 06:13.520
what you saw today to anyone.

06:13.950 --> 06:14.390
Yes.

06:18.390 --> 06:19.190
Third Master,

06:19.560 --> 06:20.920
Should I send someone

06:21.070 --> 06:21.510
to

06:21.750 --> 06:23.120
investigate what happened?

06:23.120 --> 06:23.720
No need.

06:24.800 --> 06:26.270
I don't need those methods

06:26.680 --> 06:28.410
when it comes to Jinzhao and me.

06:28.870 --> 06:30.270
She will tell me herself.

06:31.000 --> 06:31.510
Yes.

06:44.870 --> 06:46.330
Okay, pass down the order.

06:46.680 --> 06:47.190
Madam.

06:54.190 --> 06:55.120
Why are you here?

06:56.430 --> 06:58.000
I went to the Ministry of Revenue

06:58.000 --> 06:58.600
and came by

06:58.750 --> 07:00.010
on my way to take a look.

07:00.360 --> 07:01.680
I also stopped in
to offer my congratulations

07:01.680 --> 07:03.610
to Third Miss on her new residence.

07:07.950 --> 07:08.680
Good timing.

07:09.160 --> 07:10.330
I want to go back too.

07:11.270 --> 07:11.720
Okay.

07:12.560 --> 07:13.360
Let's go home.

07:20.830 --> 07:22.560
I still need to go to
the Hall of Literary Profundity.

07:22.560 --> 07:24.020
You go back and rest first.

07:25.600 --> 07:26.240
Okay.

07:40.270 --> 07:42.400
I always thought of him as a gentleman,

07:44.040 --> 07:45.310
yet I never expected him

07:45.310 --> 07:46.840
to say something like this.

07:48.040 --> 07:48.510
My Lady,

07:49.120 --> 07:50.320
do you think we should

07:50.630 --> 07:52.070
tell Third Master about this?

07:52.070 --> 07:53.070
I should tell him.

07:54.750 --> 07:56.430
But if it is made clear,

07:56.680 --> 07:58.010
given Yanyun's temper,

07:58.600 --> 08:00.950
the marriage between
Chen Xuanqing and Wanxue

08:00.950 --> 08:02.080
might be called off.

08:02.120 --> 08:03.000
Yet Wanxue

08:03.480 --> 08:04.160
is determined

08:04.160 --> 08:05.490
to marry Chen Xuanqing.

08:08.830 --> 08:09.270
Well,

08:10.190 --> 08:11.310
pass on my words—

08:11.720 --> 08:13.050
without my permission,

08:13.600 --> 08:14.930
even if I am not present,

08:15.000 --> 08:16.480
Chen Xuanqing is not to be allowed

08:16.480 --> 08:17.610
into our courtyard.

08:18.310 --> 08:19.600
You also need to pay more attention

08:19.600 --> 08:20.860
and keep a close watch.

08:21.000 --> 08:21.800
Whether it is

08:22.160 --> 08:24.020
paying respects or having meals,

08:24.630 --> 08:26.390
as long as Chen Xuanqing is there,

08:26.390 --> 08:27.320
I won't go over.

08:27.830 --> 08:29.430
I'll try my best to avoid him.

08:30.120 --> 08:30.680
Yes.

08:31.510 --> 08:32.720
Put the stir-fried bamboo shoots here.

08:32.720 --> 08:33.789
Old Madam likes this.

08:33.789 --> 08:34.320
Hurry up.

08:34.510 --> 08:35.390
-Yes.
-Yes.

08:36.789 --> 08:38.440
Check the kitchen

08:38.440 --> 08:39.440
for any hot dishes

08:39.440 --> 08:40.240
and bring them all out.

08:40.240 --> 08:40.669
Yes.

08:42.669 --> 08:43.900
Be quick.

08:44.120 --> 08:45.450
Arrange them properly.

08:48.510 --> 08:49.600
Xuanqing.

08:50.480 --> 08:52.840
Have you been busy with your duties

08:52.840 --> 08:54.040
at the office lately?

08:55.390 --> 08:56.190
Grandmother.

08:56.510 --> 08:57.440
These days,

08:57.600 --> 08:58.030
the Hanlin Academy

08:58.030 --> 08:59.840
has been compiling
the Great Yan Code of Statutes,

08:59.840 --> 09:01.510
so it's a bit busier than before.

09:01.510 --> 09:02.270
But it's fine.

09:02.270 --> 09:03.130
I can handle it.

09:04.080 --> 09:05.120
Good.

09:06.120 --> 09:08.120
The other day, Madam Yu

09:08.120 --> 09:09.320
came by and mentioned

09:09.960 --> 09:12.330
the marriage between you and Wanxue.

09:14.670 --> 09:15.360
Old Madam.

09:18.200 --> 09:18.760
Our Madam

09:18.780 --> 09:20.270
may be a little tired from the day.

09:20.270 --> 09:22.270
She's feeling a bit unwell right now,

09:22.270 --> 09:24.530
so she won't be coming to dinner tonight.

09:25.000 --> 09:26.640
Since she's unwell,

09:27.030 --> 09:28.720
let her rest properly.

09:29.440 --> 09:32.200
She doesn't need to come
pay her respects tomorrow either.

09:32.200 --> 09:32.670
Yes.

09:37.320 --> 09:38.180
Let's eat then.

09:55.630 --> 09:56.780
What time is it?

09:58.390 --> 10:00.740
Is it time to go to court?

10:02.040 --> 10:03.440
There's still some time.

10:08.270 --> 10:09.800
You've been so busy lately.

10:10.360 --> 10:11.030
Yes.

10:12.790 --> 10:14.790
The summer floods are approaching,

10:15.000 --> 10:17.360
and riverworks must be prepared.

10:17.670 --> 10:18.720
Officials from all regions

10:18.720 --> 10:20.750
have come to the capital for funding.

10:20.750 --> 10:21.810
If that's the case,

10:21.870 --> 10:24.130
you won't be getting much sleep each day.

10:25.120 --> 10:26.200
In that case,

10:27.390 --> 10:30.550
you might as well stay overnight
at the Hall of Literary Profundity

10:30.550 --> 10:33.350
and save yourself the time
of going back and forth.

10:45.510 --> 10:46.320
What's wrong?

10:50.750 --> 10:52.010
You were fine just now.

10:52.670 --> 10:53.870
Why the long face?

10:54.510 --> 10:57.510
You want me to stay
at the Hall of Literary Profundity?

10:58.910 --> 11:00.340
Of course I don't.

11:02.170 --> 11:03.320
I wish you

11:03.630 --> 11:05.090
could be at home every day.

11:05.440 --> 11:06.910
Since we got married,

11:07.840 --> 11:09.420
except for visiting my parents,

11:09.420 --> 11:10.720
we haven't had the chance

11:10.720 --> 11:12.180
to go out for a proper walk.

11:14.640 --> 11:16.920
I was just worried you might be tired.

11:20.870 --> 11:22.420
Then let's take a walk now.

11:28.550 --> 11:30.590
What is the punishment for roaming

11:30.680 --> 11:31.910
in the streets during curfew hours?

11:31.910 --> 11:34.110
I have a special edict from His Majesty.

11:34.860 --> 11:37.520
Our Third Master
really carries a lot of weight.

11:37.800 --> 11:39.240
You're acting indignant?

11:39.240 --> 11:40.150
More than that.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.530
I want to impeach you.

11:42.270 --> 11:43.390
For what?

11:43.390 --> 11:45.450
For waking me up early in the morning,

11:46.170 --> 11:47.500
and giving me attitude.

11:47.550 --> 11:48.630
Still holding a grudge?

11:48.630 --> 11:49.720
Of course.

11:49.360 --> 11:52.190
♪ A good moment is strewn with starlight ♪

11:49.790 --> 11:50.720
For a long time.

11:52.510 --> 11:53.950
Then keep holding it.

11:53.110 --> 11:56.430
♪ Flames burn away
the frost of bygone days ♪

11:54.960 --> 11:55.950
Don't forget.

11:57.390 --> 12:01.350
♪ Reflections tremble,
hearts beat in unison ♪

12:03.170 --> 12:06.050
♪ Candlelight weaves the web of fate ♪

12:07.350 --> 12:09.960
♪ Petal shadows
trace the lines of your face ♪

12:11.080 --> 12:14.680
♪ Fleeting light
sketches the shape of fate ♪

12:15.570 --> 12:19.160
♪ Footsteps fall lightly,
yet feelings can't be concealed ♪

12:20.160 --> 12:24.440
♪ In a backward glance,
a few hidden feelings slip through ♪

12:26.790 --> 12:28.900
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

12:29.620 --> 12:31.120
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

12:32.580 --> 12:35.940
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

12:34.120 --> 12:34.870
Fine.

12:35.840 --> 12:37.640
Seeing no sadness on her face

12:36.950 --> 12:39.240
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

12:37.720 --> 12:39.270
and how happy she is,

12:40.200 --> 12:41.810
if there are things
she doesn't want to say,

12:40.400 --> 12:44.120
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

12:42.240 --> 12:43.370
then let it be.

12:44.960 --> 12:47.090
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

12:47.850 --> 12:49.560
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

12:50.680 --> 12:55.170
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

12:56.320 --> 12:59.970
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

13:02.010 --> 13:05.960
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

13:26.070 --> 13:28.820
[A Heart of Purity and Loftiness]

13:31.790 --> 13:32.630
My Lady.

13:34.200 --> 13:34.750
My Lady.

13:35.440 --> 13:35.960
Where did you go

13:35.960 --> 13:37.090
early this morning?

13:37.240 --> 13:38.240
I knocked on the door for a long time

13:38.240 --> 13:39.150
and no one answered.

13:39.150 --> 13:40.000
I opened the door

13:40.000 --> 13:41.120
and found that there was no one inside.

13:41.120 --> 13:42.380
You scared me to death.

13:45.440 --> 13:47.500
In the morning, Third Master and I...

13:51.360 --> 13:52.120
How could Third Master

13:52.120 --> 13:53.630
do something so outrageous?

13:53.630 --> 13:54.700
Come on.

13:54.870 --> 13:56.360
Has he ever done anything

13:56.360 --> 13:57.760
that wasn't outrageous?

13:58.440 --> 13:58.960
My Lady.

13:59.750 --> 14:00.550
That person

14:00.790 --> 14:02.150
already left this morning.

14:02.150 --> 14:02.680
Let's go.

14:02.960 --> 14:04.960
Let's pay respects to the Old Madam.

14:06.480 --> 14:08.340
Do you mean that the moment I left,

14:08.440 --> 14:09.140
Gu Jinzhao went to

14:09.140 --> 14:10.720
pay respects to Grandmother?

14:10.720 --> 14:11.320
Yes.

14:11.870 --> 14:12.670
Young Master.

14:12.670 --> 14:13.320
Also,

14:14.080 --> 14:16.280
the Old Madam has entrusted Third Madam

14:16.510 --> 14:17.150
with handling

14:17.150 --> 14:18.720
your engagement to Miss Yu.

14:20.360 --> 14:20.870
What?

14:23.200 --> 14:23.910
Isn't this matter

14:23.910 --> 14:25.640
always managed by Second Aunt?

14:25.840 --> 14:27.550
How did it become her responsibility?

14:27.550 --> 14:28.680
I don't know either.

14:29.030 --> 14:30.080
I heard that

14:30.600 --> 14:32.610
Third Madam volunteered for it.

14:33.000 --> 14:34.200
She did it on purpose.

14:34.480 --> 14:35.550
I think so too.

14:36.080 --> 14:36.870
Young Master.

14:36.870 --> 14:38.440
Third Madam has made it clear

14:38.440 --> 14:39.960
she wants to keep her distance from you.

14:39.960 --> 14:41.910
You should also
keep your distance from now on.

14:41.910 --> 14:43.840
Don't let any ridicule arise

14:44.440 --> 14:46.700
once Miss Yu marries into the household.

14:46.750 --> 14:47.790
Gu Jinzhao.

14:51.840 --> 14:52.640
Young Master.

14:52.790 --> 14:53.920
Where are you going?

15:07.790 --> 15:09.200
Young Master, please stop.

15:09.200 --> 15:10.790
If you are looking for Third Master,

15:10.790 --> 15:12.510
just go to the front courtyard study.

15:12.510 --> 15:14.080
This is the inner courtyard—

15:14.080 --> 15:14.960
please

15:15.320 --> 15:16.250
mind propriety.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.730
I am looking for Third Aunt.

15:22.840 --> 15:24.270
I need to consult her on something.

15:24.270 --> 15:26.080
You are a dignified Hanlin scholar.

15:26.080 --> 15:26.550
What could you possibly

15:26.550 --> 15:28.150
need to consult Madam about?

15:28.390 --> 15:29.380
Madam has been busy

15:29.380 --> 15:31.000
with your marriage these past few days.

15:31.000 --> 15:32.750
She is occupied with many matters

15:32.750 --> 15:34.480
and has ordered that no one be seen.

15:34.480 --> 15:35.340
Please go back.

15:36.550 --> 15:36.960
Fine.

15:39.320 --> 15:39.670
Fine.

16:17.680 --> 16:20.380
♪ Who, deep beneath the water ♪

16:21.740 --> 16:24.680
♪ Once shared the warmth of a palm ♪

16:26.370 --> 16:30.150
♪ Setting the gears of fate ♪

16:31.120 --> 16:33.980
♪ In motion ♪

16:35.580 --> 16:38.250
♪ One curtain divides two worlds ♪

16:39.700 --> 16:42.430
♪ Winter and spring
entrust their unspoken feelings ♪

16:44.420 --> 16:52.500
♪ Sparks dance in the air,
lighting up the night ♪

16:53.180 --> 16:56.040
♪ Alone, drunk in a fleeting dream ♪

16:57.350 --> 17:00.390
♪ In dreams, I miss you, beyond words ♪

17:01.890 --> 17:05.810
♪ My hand gently brushes past,
and dust settles on the scroll ♪

17:06.569 --> 17:07.970
♪ Amid endless twists and turns ♪

17:08.900 --> 17:10.200
♪ Love quietly sinks into silence ♪

17:10.930 --> 17:13.810
♪ Time can never be looked back upon ♪

17:15.430 --> 17:18.069
♪ I only regret missing
even a moment of togetherness ♪

17:18.910 --> 17:21.319
♪ If longing bears no fruit ♪

17:22.460 --> 17:28.319
♪ I'd rather we both sink away ♪

17:27.650 --> 17:31.670
[Ancestral Virtues, Our Guiding Light]

17:32.510 --> 17:33.310
Two thousand.

17:34.030 --> 17:34.830
Five hundred.

17:45.960 --> 17:47.240
Why hasn't the account from
the Prince Ning'an's residence

17:47.240 --> 17:48.510
been recovered yet?

17:49.830 --> 17:51.440
I've urged them several times.

17:51.440 --> 17:52.840
But they are indeed poor.

17:52.920 --> 17:54.240
Over a bit of property,

17:54.510 --> 17:56.000
concubines and illegitimate children

17:56.000 --> 17:57.830
are ready to fight to the death.

17:58.640 --> 17:59.750
As for the Prince himself,

17:59.750 --> 18:01.510
he only indulges in pleasure

18:01.510 --> 18:03.510
and spends lavishly without restraint.

18:03.510 --> 18:04.680
I don't think

18:04.790 --> 18:06.400
they'll be able to

18:06.590 --> 18:08.320
repay the silver anytime soon.

18:08.480 --> 18:09.160
But

18:09.510 --> 18:11.200
it's the Prince's household after all.

18:11.200 --> 18:12.000
Maybe

18:12.160 --> 18:13.550
they're still somewhat useful.

18:13.550 --> 18:14.880
What use could they have?

18:14.880 --> 18:16.440
At your last tea gathering,

18:16.880 --> 18:18.720
Lord Chen's wife behaved disgracefully

18:18.720 --> 18:20.250
and left you feeling upset.

18:20.400 --> 18:21.920
I couldn't stand it either,

18:21.920 --> 18:23.750
so I wanted to get back at her for you

18:23.750 --> 18:25.000
and help you get even.

18:25.350 --> 18:27.150
How do you plan to get even for me?

18:27.790 --> 18:28.790
Master is back.

18:35.750 --> 18:37.030
What are you whispering about?

18:37.030 --> 18:37.880
So sneaky.

18:37.880 --> 18:38.810
Prime Minister.

18:39.920 --> 18:43.200
We were just discussing
how to give Chen Yanyun some trouble.

18:43.200 --> 18:44.160
That's good.

18:44.920 --> 18:45.520
Good idea.

18:45.640 --> 18:47.440
Then think it through properly.

18:51.070 --> 18:51.790
Go on.

18:58.960 --> 19:00.790
Today is the opening of Linxia Restaurant.

19:00.790 --> 19:02.440
Why didn't you wait for me there,

19:02.440 --> 19:04.500
but came all the way here to pick me up?

19:04.510 --> 19:05.110
By the way,

19:05.310 --> 19:06.030
on the 8th,

19:06.270 --> 19:08.530
Lian and Yao Wenxiu are getting married.

19:08.640 --> 19:10.970
Do you plan to go
in the morning of that day,

19:11.160 --> 19:13.820
or stay at Daxin the night before?

19:14.310 --> 19:15.650
I'll just go on that day.

19:15.750 --> 19:16.810
Anyway, they won't

19:16.880 --> 19:18.610
be too pleased even if I show up.

19:21.030 --> 19:21.750
Zhao.

19:24.200 --> 19:25.930
I have a presumptuous request.

19:26.640 --> 19:27.200
Go ahead.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.790
It's the Mu family.

19:31.920 --> 19:33.030
They want to propose marriage.

19:33.030 --> 19:33.680
What?

19:34.640 --> 19:35.590
Speak louder.

19:37.590 --> 19:39.850
The Mu family wants to propose marriage.

19:40.830 --> 19:42.900
I don't want them to go to Daxin.

19:43.030 --> 19:44.720
Can they go to the Chen residence

19:44.720 --> 19:46.320
to discuss it with you, Zhao?

19:47.030 --> 19:47.830
Sure.

19:48.590 --> 19:49.070
What?

19:49.200 --> 19:51.860
You don't think
Young Master Mu is dull anymore?

19:53.160 --> 19:54.960
Maybe after spending more time with him,

19:54.960 --> 19:55.680
I feel

19:55.960 --> 19:57.420
he's actually quite nice.

19:58.440 --> 20:00.030
So that's why you came here.

20:02.190 --> 20:03.200
Is Wanxue

20:03.220 --> 20:05.200
also getting married soon?

20:07.270 --> 20:07.830
Yes.

20:10.110 --> 20:11.310
In a few days,

20:11.480 --> 20:13.880
we should go to the Yu family
to set the date.

20:15.830 --> 20:16.760
It will probably

20:17.070 --> 20:18.240
happen this year.

20:19.030 --> 20:21.880
[Western Regions Tribute Hide]

20:22.020 --> 20:23.910
[Linxia Restaurant]

20:27.730 --> 20:29.250
My Lady. Madam Chen.

20:29.440 --> 20:30.640
The administrator
of the Prince Ning'an's residence

20:30.640 --> 20:31.770
has brought men

20:31.790 --> 20:33.480
and surrounded our courtyard.

20:33.480 --> 20:35.240
Mr. Luo is stopping them outside.

20:35.240 --> 20:36.900
Prince Ning'an's residence?

20:37.550 --> 20:39.480
We've never interacted with them.

20:41.270 --> 20:41.750
Well,

20:42.070 --> 20:42.960
go with Uncle Ping

20:42.960 --> 20:44.290
and see what's going on.

20:44.750 --> 20:45.750
I will stay nearby

20:45.790 --> 20:46.750
and check the situation.

20:46.750 --> 20:47.240
Okay.

20:49.750 --> 20:53.110
[Linxia Restaurant]

20:51.830 --> 20:53.680
Our shop has always been law-abiding

20:53.190 --> 20:56.360
[Opening]

20:53.680 --> 20:54.640
and paid taxes on time.

20:54.640 --> 20:56.440
We only do legitimate business.

20:56.510 --> 20:58.640
There must be some misunderstanding.

21:00.310 --> 21:01.030
Third Miss.

21:01.200 --> 21:01.860
Uncle Ping.

21:03.160 --> 21:03.920
This is

21:03.920 --> 21:05.790
the administrator
of the Prince Ning'an's residence,

21:05.790 --> 21:06.400
Lord Lai.

21:06.420 --> 21:07.030
Lord Lai.

21:07.110 --> 21:08.060
This is

21:08.200 --> 21:09.260
the owner of our shop,

21:09.260 --> 21:10.330
Miss Gu Lan.

21:11.450 --> 21:12.650
Greetings, Lord Lai.

21:13.270 --> 21:14.440
Miss Gu Lan?

21:15.350 --> 21:16.480
But I heard that

21:16.480 --> 21:18.160
the owner of Linxia Restaurant

21:18.160 --> 21:20.020
is the wife of the Grand Secretary

21:20.070 --> 21:21.400
Chen Yanyun.

21:22.000 --> 21:24.350
So you are...

21:24.530 --> 21:26.750
Madam Chen is my eldest sister.

21:27.000 --> 21:28.530
If you have anything to say,

21:28.680 --> 21:29.640
you can

21:29.880 --> 21:30.940
speak to me as well.

21:31.720 --> 21:32.350
I see.

21:33.030 --> 21:33.770
Here's the situation.

21:33.770 --> 21:37.480
[Linxia Restaurant]

21:34.110 --> 21:34.960
In our residence,

21:34.960 --> 21:36.510
there is an opera performer
who plays female roles,

21:36.510 --> 21:37.570
named Xia Xiaohan.

21:37.920 --> 21:39.310
He sings very well

21:40.040 --> 21:40.750
and is

21:41.030 --> 21:41.880
quite clever,

21:42.200 --> 21:44.130
so he is much favored by our Prince.

21:44.400 --> 21:45.350
But a while ago,

21:45.350 --> 21:46.480
he suddenly disappeared

21:46.480 --> 21:48.990
for no clear reason.

21:49.200 --> 21:50.860
I sent people to search for him

21:51.400 --> 21:53.600
and eventually found his whereabouts.

21:53.640 --> 21:54.720
He is currently here

21:54.720 --> 21:57.270
in Linxia Restaurant.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.550
So please,

21:59.550 --> 22:01.070
hand him over.

22:01.480 --> 22:03.680
So I can go back and report.

22:05.550 --> 22:06.880
Isn't Xia Xiaohan a man?

22:07.070 --> 22:07.720
Did they really hide a man?

22:07.720 --> 22:08.920
What is going on here?

22:09.550 --> 22:10.350
My Lord,

22:11.440 --> 22:13.200
our shop only receives women.

22:13.750 --> 22:15.110
All servants, maids,

22:15.110 --> 22:16.500
and kitchen staff

22:16.550 --> 22:17.680
are women.

22:18.070 --> 22:20.070
The Xia Xiaohan you mentioned

22:20.350 --> 22:22.280
couldn't possibly be hiding here.

22:22.440 --> 22:23.880
You must be mistaken.

22:24.070 --> 22:24.590
What?

22:25.270 --> 22:26.350
Miss Gu,

22:26.510 --> 22:28.380
are you deliberately hiding him?

22:28.750 --> 22:29.640
I wouldn't dare.

22:29.640 --> 22:30.440
It's just that

22:30.440 --> 22:32.410
our shop is opening today,

22:32.430 --> 22:33.880
and you've brought people here

22:33.880 --> 22:35.070
demanding someone.

22:35.280 --> 22:37.100
Isn't it too much of a coincidence?

22:37.100 --> 22:38.200
How would I know

22:38.200 --> 22:39.980
it's your opening day?

22:40.270 --> 22:42.500
I am also acting on orders.

22:42.640 --> 22:44.640
If you still refuse to hand him over,

22:44.810 --> 22:45.750
don't blame me

22:46.030 --> 22:47.270
for what comes next.

22:47.110 --> 22:50.550
[Linxia Restaurant]

22:47.440 --> 22:48.000
Guards.

22:48.200 --> 22:48.920
Search!

22:49.510 --> 22:50.030
Wait.

22:52.270 --> 22:52.880
Lord Lai.

22:53.880 --> 22:55.910
Not to mention that my sister is

22:56.000 --> 22:57.880
Grand Secretary Chen Yanyun's wife.

22:57.880 --> 22:59.810
Since our shop opens today,

23:00.000 --> 23:01.190
if you search it like this,

23:01.190 --> 23:02.070
my business

23:02.070 --> 23:03.600
will definitely be ruined.

23:03.720 --> 23:05.540
If you do find him,

23:05.830 --> 23:07.070
then I will go with you

23:07.070 --> 23:09.000
to your residence and accept punishment.

23:09.000 --> 23:10.400
But if you don't find him,

23:11.030 --> 23:12.000
then the Prince Ning'an's residence

23:12.000 --> 23:13.480
must give us

23:13.640 --> 23:14.660
an explanation.

23:15.480 --> 23:16.310
All the expenses prepared

23:16.310 --> 23:18.070
for today's opening will have to

23:18.070 --> 23:19.930
be borne by your residence.

23:20.030 --> 23:22.420
Everyone here can serve as witness.

23:22.880 --> 23:23.960
May I ask, Lord Lai,

23:24.510 --> 23:25.720
can you agree to this?

23:26.750 --> 23:27.680
They don't dare.

23:27.750 --> 23:28.440
But I do!

23:28.640 --> 23:29.300
Move aside.

23:29.550 --> 23:30.550
Shuntian Prefecture on official business!

23:30.550 --> 23:32.280
All idle persons, stand clear!

23:35.290 --> 23:37.990
[Linxia Restaurant]

23:36.400 --> 23:38.590
Shuntian Prefecture
is searching for a fugitive.

23:38.590 --> 23:40.440
All idle persons, stand clear!

23:41.070 --> 23:41.510
Go.

23:45.650 --> 23:47.150
[Linxia Restaurant]

23:48.740 --> 23:50.270
[Seal by Shuntian Prefecture
in the capital]

23:57.110 --> 23:58.120
Zhao.

23:58.270 --> 23:59.920
The Shuntian Prefecture officers
are here now.

23:59.920 --> 24:01.580
Should we inform Chen Yanyun?

24:07.740 --> 24:09.590
[Linxia Restaurant]

24:09.110 --> 24:09.770
Third Miss.

24:11.030 --> 24:11.700
Uncle Ping.

24:12.550 --> 24:14.030
No matter how much silver it costs,

24:14.030 --> 24:15.070
get their lead officer

24:15.070 --> 24:16.480
into the private room opposite.

24:16.480 --> 24:18.000
I have something to ask him.

24:18.000 --> 24:18.550
Yes.

24:25.490 --> 24:28.300
[Opening]

24:27.880 --> 24:29.240
Thank you.

24:29.510 --> 24:30.200
Please.

24:47.920 --> 24:48.790
You guys go out first.

24:48.790 --> 24:49.240
Yes.

24:52.680 --> 24:54.480
You're showing me such respect—

24:54.610 --> 24:56.200
if I still dodge you,

24:56.200 --> 24:57.480
I wouldn't be a man.

24:57.880 --> 24:59.110
Honestly, I'm not

24:59.110 --> 25:00.440
that sure either.

25:00.880 --> 25:01.590
Miss Gu.

25:01.700 --> 25:03.430
Why don't you think carefully.

25:03.720 --> 25:05.070
Has your backer

25:05.200 --> 25:05.880
offended anyone

25:05.880 --> 25:06.920
recently?

25:07.370 --> 25:09.000
With someone of her status,

25:09.110 --> 25:10.920
there can't be many who would dare

25:10.920 --> 25:12.050
to cross her, right?

25:14.110 --> 25:14.770
Uncle Ping.

25:20.240 --> 25:21.640
I am busy with official duties,

25:21.640 --> 25:22.680
so I won't disturb you further.

25:22.680 --> 25:23.280
Farewell.

25:28.550 --> 25:30.070
I've seen this kind of thing so much,

25:30.070 --> 25:30.640
so it's really nothing

25:30.640 --> 25:31.770
to make a fuss about.

25:33.070 --> 25:33.600
Jinzhao.

25:35.720 --> 25:36.650
Why are you here?

25:37.350 --> 25:38.480
How could I not come?

25:50.960 --> 25:52.270
Chen Yi has already

25:52.270 --> 25:53.400
told me everything.

25:53.640 --> 25:54.590
I'll go with you

25:54.590 --> 25:55.720
to the Shuntian Prefecture.

25:55.720 --> 25:56.680
No need.

25:57.880 --> 26:00.000
I already have some leads on this matter.

26:00.000 --> 26:00.600
Moreover,

26:00.960 --> 26:03.440
the root cause is not
the Shuntian Prefecture.

26:03.440 --> 26:04.160
You should go back

26:04.160 --> 26:05.960
to the Hall of Literary Profundity.

26:05.960 --> 26:07.160
Don't worry about me.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.930
What are you talking about?

26:10.310 --> 26:11.510
How could I not worry?

26:12.070 --> 26:12.640
I know

26:12.640 --> 26:14.270
you're used to the schemes
of the business world.

26:14.270 --> 26:14.960
But since this

26:14.960 --> 26:16.550
has involved
the Prince Ning'an's residence

26:16.550 --> 26:17.720
and Shuntian Prefecture,

26:17.720 --> 26:19.250
I naturally have to step in.

26:19.920 --> 26:21.450
It's really not necessary.

26:21.550 --> 26:22.640
I've always

26:22.640 --> 26:23.840
dealt with

26:23.960 --> 26:25.460
the authorities myself.

26:26.110 --> 26:27.280
You have to trust me.

26:27.920 --> 26:28.790
Besides,

26:28.830 --> 26:30.340
if I rely on you whenever

26:30.400 --> 26:31.550
I encounter a problem,

26:31.550 --> 26:32.580
wouldn't that be

26:32.680 --> 26:33.920
using your name

26:34.000 --> 26:35.330
to do business outside?

26:35.680 --> 26:37.310
If the imperial censor finds out,

26:37.310 --> 26:38.640
it won't be good for you.

26:41.590 --> 26:42.350
Actually,

26:42.510 --> 26:44.370
you don't need to think that much.

26:44.790 --> 26:45.680
I got it.

26:53.550 --> 26:54.080
Alright.

26:54.110 --> 26:55.820
Let's do it your way.

26:56.400 --> 26:57.330
I'm leaving now.

27:01.920 --> 27:02.720
Third Master.

27:02.790 --> 27:03.480
The Shuntian Prefecture must have

27:03.480 --> 27:05.030
some serious nerve to openly

27:05.030 --> 27:06.430
trouble Madam like this.

27:08.480 --> 27:11.440
Zheng Xiaoyou is the Governor
of Shuntian Prefecture,

27:11.440 --> 27:13.500
a third-grade official of the court.

27:13.830 --> 27:14.720
Since he is so willing

27:14.720 --> 27:16.120
to be Wang Xuanfan's dog,

27:17.590 --> 27:18.190
very well.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.310
Let's deal

27:22.070 --> 27:23.110
with him first.

27:27.050 --> 27:30.090
[Hall of Literary Profundity]

27:38.460 --> 27:44.150
[Perfect Harmony]

27:48.830 --> 27:49.400
Mentor,

27:52.000 --> 27:53.400
I must take my leave.

27:54.110 --> 27:56.170
My wife's shop opened today,

27:56.760 --> 27:59.280
but she was framed

27:59.440 --> 28:02.170
and the Shuntian Prefecture
ended up sealing it.

28:06.510 --> 28:07.970
Which scoundrel did this?

28:08.790 --> 28:10.540
Has the Shuntian Prefecture

28:10.790 --> 28:12.050
no sense of shame left?

28:12.160 --> 28:12.720
Right.

28:13.920 --> 28:15.050
I was also wondering

28:15.750 --> 28:17.340
how the Shuntian Prefecture

28:17.340 --> 28:18.540
could be so arrogant.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.550
They must have

28:20.070 --> 28:21.350
someone backing them.

28:22.110 --> 28:23.120
Fortunately,

28:23.290 --> 28:24.970
the truth will come out.

28:25.740 --> 28:27.540
As for the person behind this...

28:45.770 --> 28:47.170
Why are you looking at me?

28:47.180 --> 28:49.380
What do you think, Prime Minister Wang?

29:07.460 --> 29:11.320
[Perfect Harmony]

29:11.640 --> 29:13.100
He is really interesting.

29:13.440 --> 29:14.110
What

29:14.480 --> 29:15.770
does it have to do with me

29:15.770 --> 29:17.770
if his wife suffered a loss outside?

29:23.370 --> 29:25.710
[House of Virtue and Brilliance]

29:24.830 --> 29:27.400
Yanyun is a Grand Secretary,

29:25.780 --> 29:30.430
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

29:27.680 --> 29:29.160
and you are his wife.

29:30.000 --> 29:31.960
It's not worth

29:32.400 --> 29:34.550
letting the whole capital see a joke

29:34.960 --> 29:36.240
over such petty gains.

29:38.790 --> 29:39.880
Listen to me.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.790
For Yanyun's reputation,

29:43.640 --> 29:46.000
whether it's Linxia Restaurant

29:46.000 --> 29:47.640
or any other business,

29:48.270 --> 29:50.070
no matter how profitable,

29:51.400 --> 29:52.660
stop running them all.

29:57.240 --> 29:58.500
You are right, Mother.

29:58.920 --> 30:01.400
That's exactly what I was thinking.

30:03.310 --> 30:04.970
It's wrong to think like that.

30:06.470 --> 30:07.740
[Orchid Chamber Fragrance]

30:11.440 --> 30:11.960
Mother.

30:13.350 --> 30:15.350
You came back early today.

30:16.110 --> 30:17.130
I heard

30:17.170 --> 30:18.600
something happened at Linxia Restaurant,

30:18.600 --> 30:19.650
so I hurried back.

30:31.270 --> 30:32.500
The business of Linxia Restaurant

30:32.500 --> 30:33.750
should not only continue—

30:33.750 --> 30:34.920
it must be done well.

30:37.270 --> 30:38.160
Third Master.

30:40.550 --> 30:43.010
It's already turned
into such a scene today.

30:43.070 --> 30:45.750
Aren't you afraid
it will damage your reputation?

30:45.750 --> 30:46.510
Mother.

30:47.350 --> 30:49.210
What truly damages my reputation

30:49.290 --> 30:50.750
is not Linxia Restaurant,

30:51.270 --> 30:53.390
but those who try

30:53.880 --> 30:54.590
every possible means

30:54.590 --> 30:55.990
to bully my wife.

30:56.310 --> 30:57.000
If Jinzhao

30:57.000 --> 30:59.050
were to stop
all her businesses because of this,

30:59.050 --> 31:00.240
wouldn't that make it seem like

31:00.240 --> 31:01.240
I truly fear them?

31:02.350 --> 31:04.280
That would be the real loss of face.

31:07.000 --> 31:09.000
That's true.

31:09.380 --> 31:13.610
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

31:22.790 --> 31:24.160
You're already married to me,

31:24.160 --> 31:25.870
and you still like sneaking looks at me?

31:25.870 --> 31:27.880
You really know how to play the good cop.

31:27.880 --> 31:29.810
No wonder you like playing Guan Yu.

31:30.510 --> 31:31.440
Of course.

31:32.090 --> 31:33.940
I'm used to playing the good cop.

31:39.250 --> 31:40.040
Chen Yi.

31:40.250 --> 31:42.740
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

31:40.340 --> 31:41.610
Tell her

31:41.960 --> 31:43.020
what you found out.

31:43.170 --> 31:43.590
Yes.

31:44.590 --> 31:45.000
Madam.

31:45.300 --> 31:46.270
Prince Ning'an's residence

31:46.270 --> 31:47.750
did lose an opera performer.

31:47.750 --> 31:49.270
-But that was years...
-My Lady.

31:49.270 --> 31:50.070
Third Master.

31:50.310 --> 31:51.410
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

31:51.680 --> 31:52.640
I've found it out.

31:52.640 --> 31:53.250
How is it?

31:53.400 --> 31:54.480
Just as you expected,

31:54.480 --> 31:55.640
the person behind this

31:55.640 --> 31:57.000
is Wang Xuanfan's wife.

32:03.960 --> 32:05.070
I followed Lord Lai

32:05.070 --> 32:06.640
back to the Prince Ning'an's residence.

32:06.640 --> 32:07.510
Not long after,

32:07.920 --> 32:08.960
Mrs. Wang's servant

32:08.960 --> 32:10.110
also entered the residence.

32:10.110 --> 32:11.960
Lord Lai then hurried out again,

32:12.110 --> 32:13.170
and I followed him.

32:13.480 --> 32:14.210
He turned out

32:14.720 --> 32:16.750
to be going to a pawnshop
to redeem something.

32:16.750 --> 32:18.750
I spent some silver to investigate.

32:18.790 --> 32:19.440
Unexpectedly,

32:19.440 --> 32:21.510
what he redeemed
was the Imperial Pardon Certificate.

32:21.510 --> 32:22.790
The Imperial Pardon Certificate?

32:22.790 --> 32:25.250
That is an item
bestowed by the late Emperor.

32:26.070 --> 32:27.160
Prince Ning'an

32:28.070 --> 32:29.670
must be tired of living.

32:29.720 --> 32:31.440
-Actually, I found out that...
-In that case,

32:31.440 --> 32:32.440
it makes sense.

32:33.310 --> 32:34.350
For a dignified prince,

32:34.350 --> 32:35.920
even if he owed some silver,

32:36.200 --> 32:37.310
he would not willingly

32:37.310 --> 32:38.910
become someone else's tool.

32:38.960 --> 32:40.090
I never expected him

32:40.270 --> 32:42.600
to pawn the Imperial Pardon Certificate.

32:42.750 --> 32:43.770
If Mrs. Wang

32:44.000 --> 32:44.640
is willing to forgive

32:44.640 --> 32:46.160
part of the debts

32:46.550 --> 32:48.070
and lend him another sum

32:48.420 --> 32:49.920
for its redemption,

32:50.720 --> 32:52.160
then the Prince's residence

32:52.160 --> 32:54.090
would naturally follow her orders

32:54.160 --> 32:55.350
and be at her disposal.

32:55.350 --> 32:56.160
So

32:56.680 --> 32:57.830
the Prince's residence has also borrowed

32:57.830 --> 32:59.430
Mrs. Wang's usurious loans.

33:00.110 --> 33:01.200
You knew Mrs. Wang

33:01.350 --> 33:03.310
was lending money
at exorbitant interest outside?

33:03.310 --> 33:04.400
How did you know?

33:05.270 --> 33:06.400
At the tea party,

33:06.800 --> 33:08.400
she made things so difficult for me,

33:08.400 --> 33:09.750
so I naturally had someone

33:09.750 --> 33:11.210
look into her background.

33:11.750 --> 33:12.350
And once

33:12.750 --> 33:13.680
I looked into it,

33:13.790 --> 33:14.550
I found

33:14.550 --> 33:16.640
she was lending money outside at interest—

33:16.640 --> 33:18.740
and at usurious rates.

33:19.110 --> 33:19.510
I found out...

33:19.510 --> 33:20.310
The Prince of Ning'an's residence

33:20.310 --> 33:22.240
owes Mrs. Wang a full 20,000 taels.

33:22.680 --> 33:23.960
That's the result of compound interest.

33:23.960 --> 33:25.690
Unable to repay,

33:25.830 --> 33:28.210
and with Mrs. Wang knowing

33:28.310 --> 33:30.240
they have pawned
the Imperial Pardon Certificate,

33:30.240 --> 33:31.750
they are forced to submit to her control.

33:31.750 --> 33:32.750
Coincidentally,

33:32.880 --> 33:34.590
she also bears a grudge against me

33:34.590 --> 33:36.640
for exposing her involvement
in imperial tribute goods,

33:36.640 --> 33:38.480
so she had the Prince frame

33:38.880 --> 33:40.030
and retaliate against me.

33:40.030 --> 33:41.200
You are right, Madam.

33:41.200 --> 33:42.270
This is exactly

33:42.590 --> 33:43.320
what I found.

33:43.840 --> 33:46.110
As a court ennobled lady,
Mrs. Wang is already

33:46.110 --> 33:48.160
violating the law
by lending money outside.

33:48.160 --> 33:49.560
To use usurious interest

33:49.590 --> 33:50.880
to threaten military nobility

33:50.880 --> 33:52.240
is truly audacious.

33:53.510 --> 33:54.510
I can have someone

33:54.590 --> 33:55.850
impeach Wang Xuanfan.

33:57.400 --> 33:58.800
How far can you go with it?

34:04.960 --> 34:05.510
How far

34:05.510 --> 34:06.570
do you want me to go?

34:07.550 --> 34:09.000
If we can't

34:09.000 --> 34:10.670
bring down Wang Xuanfan in one move,

34:10.670 --> 34:12.270
then there's no need to rush.

34:13.400 --> 34:14.630
We can try my method

34:14.710 --> 34:15.400
first.

34:17.590 --> 34:18.320
What method?

34:19.440 --> 34:20.550
A woman's method.

34:21.590 --> 34:23.190
You're quite strong-willed.

34:23.190 --> 34:24.710
I've always been strong-willed.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.230
Qingpu.

34:34.880 --> 34:35.679
Third Master.

34:35.760 --> 34:37.120
I didn't expect

34:37.190 --> 34:38.590
Madam to get information

34:38.710 --> 34:39.590
this fast—

34:40.230 --> 34:41.330
and so thoroughly.

34:41.710 --> 34:42.590
It seems

34:42.590 --> 34:44.230
the people you placed in the capital

34:44.230 --> 34:45.360
are a waste of money.

34:46.230 --> 34:47.030
Third Master.

34:48.510 --> 34:50.440
About the 100,000 winter clothes
in the Ministry of War,

34:50.440 --> 34:51.940
we have a lead.

34:54.230 --> 34:55.670
The Armory Bureau did a spot check

34:55.670 --> 34:56.840
and found that half
of the 100,000 garments

34:56.840 --> 34:58.670
destined for the Nine Border Garrisons

34:58.670 --> 34:59.360
were filled with

34:59.360 --> 35:00.980
moldy, black cotton.

35:01.800 --> 35:03.070
But the contractor

35:03.070 --> 35:04.400
is the Dai family,
the maternal relatives of

35:04.400 --> 35:05.200
Mr. Fu's wife.

35:05.630 --> 35:06.900
So the Armory Bureau

35:06.960 --> 35:08.110
neither dares to report the matter

35:08.110 --> 35:08.960
upward

35:09.360 --> 35:10.280
nor dares to actually

35:10.280 --> 35:12.030
dispatch the garments
to Nine Border Garrisons.

35:12.030 --> 35:13.230
They are in a dilemma.

35:17.550 --> 35:18.110
Chen Yi.

35:19.030 --> 35:20.030
Pass this information

35:20.030 --> 35:21.000
to Qingpu.

35:21.920 --> 35:22.440
But

35:22.550 --> 35:23.950
do not say it came from me.

35:24.840 --> 35:25.320
Yes.

35:29.510 --> 35:30.110
Mr. Jiang.

35:32.070 --> 35:33.400
What does the matter
of the winter garments

35:33.400 --> 35:34.670
have to do with Madam?

35:36.840 --> 35:38.440
It has nothing to do with her.

35:38.630 --> 35:39.580
But if Madam

35:39.800 --> 35:41.280
can solve this,

35:41.510 --> 35:42.350
it would be

35:42.440 --> 35:44.550
a favor to
the Senior Grand Secretary's wife.

35:44.550 --> 35:46.350
It's benefits would be endless.

35:46.800 --> 35:48.050
Think about it.

35:48.480 --> 35:49.190
The key is

35:49.590 --> 35:51.320
not to let Madam realize that

35:51.630 --> 35:54.090
Third Master instructed you
to pass this on.

35:54.390 --> 35:55.140
But, but...

35:55.320 --> 35:56.230
why is that?

35:57.230 --> 35:58.150
You wouldn't understand
even if I explained it.

35:58.150 --> 35:59.410
Just do as you're told.

36:06.320 --> 36:07.780
Ever since that incident,

36:07.920 --> 36:10.360
people have been talking
about Linxia Restaurant—

36:10.360 --> 36:12.140
saying it only caters to women,

36:12.280 --> 36:13.110
and who knows

36:13.190 --> 36:15.320
what kind of filthy place it really is.

36:16.400 --> 36:18.730
That's why I said your idea was brilliant.

36:18.760 --> 36:20.190
This batch of plain silk is quite fine.

36:20.190 --> 36:21.150
It's yours.

36:21.550 --> 36:22.550
Thank you, Madam.

36:23.760 --> 36:26.540
This was an open scheme from the start.

36:26.840 --> 36:28.320
I never expected Gu Jinzhao

36:28.320 --> 36:30.190
not to find out I was the one behind it.

36:30.190 --> 36:31.970
But even if she does, so what?

36:32.480 --> 36:33.840
Can she scold me,

36:34.140 --> 36:35.330
hit me,

36:35.480 --> 36:37.110
or bite me?

36:39.150 --> 36:40.880
With Chen Yanyun's influence,

36:41.360 --> 36:44.090
Linxia Restaurant
will eventually be unsealed.

36:45.030 --> 36:47.230
But simply lifting the seal is useless.

36:48.360 --> 36:50.290
Its reputation is already ruined.

36:51.480 --> 36:52.510
In the future, if she keeps claiming

36:52.510 --> 36:54.320
to serve only women,

36:54.550 --> 36:55.800
who would dare to go?

36:56.630 --> 36:57.800
Which husband

36:58.320 --> 37:00.320
wouldn't fear that an actor

37:00.480 --> 37:01.810
or a man is hiding there?

37:03.960 --> 37:05.380
That is what it means

37:05.630 --> 37:07.760
to have grievances with nowhere to air

37:07.760 --> 37:09.820
and suffering with nowhere to speak.

37:12.550 --> 37:14.280
No one is wiser than you, Madam.

37:16.630 --> 37:17.630
Recently,

37:17.880 --> 37:20.030
we lent out another twelve thousand taels.

37:20.030 --> 37:21.800
Our capital is getting a bit tight.

37:21.800 --> 37:22.450
should we

37:22.550 --> 37:23.670
add more funds?

37:24.880 --> 37:26.410
We lent out that much again?

37:26.480 --> 37:27.710
Since last month,

37:28.070 --> 37:29.800
we've added a dozen more accounts.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.120
It's all

37:31.140 --> 37:32.340
one telling another,

37:32.480 --> 37:33.480
and they just keep coming

37:33.480 --> 37:34.540
one after another.

37:35.230 --> 37:36.710
Although the court has managed

37:36.710 --> 37:38.710
to recover quite a bit of tax silver,

37:39.440 --> 37:41.070
those destined to be poor

37:41.630 --> 37:43.000
are still poor.

37:45.030 --> 37:45.840
Then I'll give you

37:45.840 --> 37:47.500
another five thousand taels.

37:51.360 --> 37:51.920
Madam.

37:52.550 --> 37:54.550
An invitation from the Chen family.

37:58.630 --> 38:00.230
She's actually coming to us?

38:00.460 --> 38:01.920
[To Mrs. Wang.
From Gu Jinzhao of the Chen household]

38:02.700 --> 38:04.280
[Meet at Baiwei Restaurant
at 8 a.m. tomorrow.]

38:05.150 --> 38:06.880
Why arrange to meet outside?

38:09.150 --> 38:10.380
This Gu Jinzhao

38:10.400 --> 38:11.860
really has a lot of tricks.

38:14.130 --> 38:16.810
[Baiwei Restaurant]

38:15.920 --> 38:17.790
Why have you secretly arranged

38:17.920 --> 38:19.230
to meet me here?

38:20.070 --> 38:21.670
I came to return your silver.

38:22.590 --> 38:23.280
What?

38:24.150 --> 38:25.290
What silver?

38:26.000 --> 38:27.800
It's a few servants from my shop.

38:28.550 --> 38:29.150
Well,

38:29.630 --> 38:31.360
Linxia Restaurant was sealed,

38:31.510 --> 38:33.170
so I couldn't pay their wages.

38:33.590 --> 38:34.670
Their families

38:34.800 --> 38:36.130
also had some troubles.

38:36.230 --> 38:37.190
Out of desperation,

38:37.190 --> 38:39.120
they had to borrow usurious loans.

38:39.400 --> 38:40.320
Who would have thought

38:40.320 --> 38:42.180
they ended up borrowing from you.

38:43.510 --> 38:44.710
I only just found out.

38:45.480 --> 38:46.420
I said

38:46.510 --> 38:47.590
such loans should not

38:47.590 --> 38:48.820
be taken lightly.

38:49.000 --> 38:50.760
It should be repaid immediately.

38:50.760 --> 38:51.960
The total loan

38:51.430 --> 38:53.360
[IOU]

38:52.030 --> 38:53.190
is 13,000 taels.

38:53.920 --> 38:55.000
The actual amount received

38:55.000 --> 38:56.320
is 11,700 taels.

38:56.670 --> 38:57.880
The daily interest is three li.

38:57.880 --> 38:59.030
It was borrowed for seven days,

38:59.030 --> 39:00.690
but we'll calculate it as ten.

39:00.920 --> 39:02.200
So the interest alone

39:02.320 --> 39:03.570
comes to 390 taels.

39:04.030 --> 39:05.840
This is really a loan-shark debt.

39:05.840 --> 39:06.880
If they can't repay,

39:06.880 --> 39:08.740
they might even lose their lives.

39:08.960 --> 39:10.960
It's best to return it to you at once.

39:11.060 --> 39:13.310
[IOU]

39:15.060 --> 39:17.410
[IOU]

39:18.110 --> 39:19.330
What loans?

39:19.800 --> 39:21.460
What does it have to do with me?

39:22.070 --> 39:22.760
Is that so?

39:23.320 --> 39:24.490
But I heard

39:24.630 --> 39:26.140
it was your personal maid

39:26.320 --> 39:27.780
who's been lending money.

39:30.110 --> 39:30.980
Weren't you

39:31.400 --> 39:33.180
acting on Mrs. Wang's orders?

39:34.150 --> 39:35.190
Of course not.

39:36.400 --> 39:37.400
You are so young.

39:37.400 --> 39:39.200
How can you slander me like this?

39:39.510 --> 39:40.000
How could I

39:40.000 --> 39:42.360
possibly do something like moneylending?

39:42.360 --> 39:43.490
I knew it.

39:43.760 --> 39:44.910
Given your status,

39:45.070 --> 39:47.710
how could you dare
lend usurious money outside?

39:47.710 --> 39:49.170
That's a grave taboo.

39:50.070 --> 39:51.870
So this really isn't your money?

39:52.070 --> 39:53.000
Absolutely not.

39:56.880 --> 39:57.670
In that case,

39:57.960 --> 39:59.220
I won't be repaying it.

40:00.280 --> 40:00.920
Qingpu.

40:01.320 --> 40:02.510
Pass down my words.

40:03.480 --> 40:05.030
If anyone comes to collect the debt,

40:05.030 --> 40:06.310
send them to me.

40:06.960 --> 40:07.800
I will just

40:07.950 --> 40:09.880
take them to Shuntian Prefecture.

40:09.920 --> 40:11.200
What does the Great Yan Law

40:11.200 --> 40:12.310
say about this?

40:14.510 --> 40:16.630
Those who privately
lend at usurious interest

40:16.630 --> 40:18.160
shall receive 300 strokes.

40:18.800 --> 40:19.440
Mrs. Wang,

40:19.440 --> 40:20.970
we will take our leave then.

40:36.510 --> 40:37.230
Madam,

40:37.400 --> 40:38.800
I never expected that

40:38.800 --> 40:40.200
the newly added accounts

40:40.230 --> 40:41.360
were deliberately arranged

40:41.360 --> 40:42.490
by Madam Chen.

40:43.320 --> 40:45.440
I deserve to die. I deserve to die.

40:45.710 --> 40:48.250
[Baiwei Restaurant]

40:52.070 --> 40:52.590
My Lady,

40:53.150 --> 40:55.210
Mrs. Wang really refused to admit it.

40:55.440 --> 40:56.800
I never expected her to.

40:57.150 --> 40:57.880
I just wanted to

40:57.880 --> 40:59.260
give her a warning—

40:59.710 --> 41:00.690
to let her know

41:00.760 --> 41:02.090
I'm not so easy to bully.

41:03.710 --> 41:05.380
To bring down Mrs. Wang

41:05.590 --> 41:07.370
and revive Linxia Restaurant,

41:07.710 --> 41:08.910
I need another person

41:09.190 --> 41:10.000
to help me.

41:23.110 --> 41:24.110
Miss Qingpu.

41:26.230 --> 41:29.080
Why are you practicing your sword today?

41:30.280 --> 41:31.480
I practice every day.

41:37.110 --> 41:38.490
It is summer now,

41:38.630 --> 41:39.760
yet it's quite cool.

41:40.360 --> 41:40.800
Don't you feel

41:40.800 --> 41:41.840
that these past few years

41:41.840 --> 41:43.970
have been getting colder year by year?

41:44.150 --> 41:45.080
If it's this cold

41:45.280 --> 41:46.280
in the capital,

41:46.910 --> 41:47.350
it must

41:47.590 --> 41:48.980
be even worse

41:49.230 --> 41:50.690
at Nine Border Garrisons.

41:51.400 --> 41:53.150
The winter clothes for the soldiers

41:53.150 --> 41:54.280
must not be delayed.

41:56.880 --> 41:57.760
Master Yao.

41:58.400 --> 42:00.160
My Lady, Yao is here!

42:00.280 --> 42:00.760
Qingpu!

42:01.880 --> 42:02.590
My Lady.

42:05.510 --> 42:06.070
Zhao.

42:06.840 --> 42:07.400
Yao.

42:07.960 --> 42:08.920
Why did you come

42:08.940 --> 42:09.870
to see me so late?

42:10.440 --> 42:13.550
As soon as I arrived in the capital,
I came straight to your residence.

42:13.550 --> 42:15.080
Does he treat you well?

42:17.920 --> 42:18.650
That's good.

42:19.480 --> 42:20.140
Have a seat.

42:28.360 --> 42:30.620
You mean out of 100,000 winter garments,

42:31.030 --> 42:31.710
half

42:31.710 --> 42:33.310
were made with moldy cotton?

42:33.550 --> 42:34.070
Yes.

42:34.840 --> 42:36.150
No way.

42:36.890 --> 42:37.840
Back then, the Dai family

42:37.840 --> 42:39.150
relied on Madam Fu's influence

42:39.150 --> 42:40.970
to forcibly win this bid.

42:41.190 --> 42:41.710
Yet

42:42.000 --> 42:43.660
they made such a huge mistake.

42:43.760 --> 42:44.960
I suppose these days,

42:45.110 --> 42:45.590
Madam Fu

42:45.590 --> 42:47.390
must have been deeply troubled.

42:47.590 --> 42:48.630
That is why

42:48.800 --> 42:50.000
I have come to see you.

43:03.540 --> 43:06.960
[A Splendid Match]
